+<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Progressive scroll reveals and motion preference</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body><main id="top"><h1>Engineering articles</h1><blog-reveal id="reveal-one"><article><h2>Inspect the evidence</h2><p>A first card.</p><a href="#notes">Read the evidence</a></article></blog-reveal><div style="height:1400px" aria-hidden="true"></div><blog-reveal id="reveal-two"><article><h2 id="notes">Understand the limits</h2><p>A second card below the fold.</p><a href="#top">Back to top</a></article></blog-reveal></main><script>window.fixtureState={deletions:0,subscriptions:[]};window.removeSavedReport=()=>{window.fixtureState.deletions++;document.querySelector('#saved-report').hidden=true};window.acceptSubscription=email=>{window.fixtureState.subscriptions.push(email);return 'Request accepted. Check your inbox.'};</script><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>
